  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MHPSS Specialist with UNHCR - Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this deployment is to provide technical MHPSS expertise in Yunde, Uganda, specifically focused on suicide prevention and response within a refugee context. This includes a desk review and service mapping, establishing standardized referral pathways and interim Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs), exploring a national/sub-national Suicide Prevention Task Force, and developing a comprehensive capacity-building and training</narrative>
  </description>
